  "contentHtml": "<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/6e143325-c7c7-37f3-3355-975fc53161bb.png\" width=\"628\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span>Hey Brew Shop Fam!<br>Here's an update of what's happening this week - from new&nbsp;beer drops, wine reviews, our current tap list, to upcoming tastings, and more.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/XXNrI5hIssr?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP THIS WEEK’S NEWSLETTER HERE</a>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/19gRINJ7Xw9?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP OUR ENTIRE STOCK OF BEER, WINE &amp; HOMEBREW HERE</a>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/8b6d31ef-302d-1938-796b-fb770122884e.png\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span>Beer Advent Calendars will be available for pre-order starting on Monday, October 26!</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>It's never too early to prepare for the holiday season! We're excited to bring back</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> The Brew Shop Beer Advent Calendar</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>! Inside our festive box, you'll find 24 beers to carry you through the first 24 days of December. </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Available in limited quantities and by pre-order only</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>, make sure you grab your box before they sell out!<br><br>Our Beer Advent Calendar will be hand-selected by your favorite beer nerds (Beth, Julie &amp; Aidan) and filled with our latest favorites and seasonal treats. What's inside is a surprise, but expect the following: each box will contain EIGHT holiday beers, EIGHT special releases, and EIGHT shop favorites. Our holiday elves will wrap each box and number each can with all the merriment washi tape can provide!<br></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>This year's lineup will be different than last year's, but to give you an idea of what to expect, breweries included in the 2025 Brew Shop Advent Calendar included brews from: Ocelot, Wheatland Spring, Forest &amp; Main, Schilling, Parish, The Veil, Bluejacket, Halfway Crooks, Adroit Theory, and many, many more!</span></span></span></p>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/3fd3d646-5086-4044-b45e-b0ddc309d0af.png\" width=\"612\" alt=\"Grid45WeeklyTasting_5.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>Join us this</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Friday from 5-7 PM</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> as we welcome </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Abby&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>from</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>&nbsp;Allagash&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>for our free tasting! This week’s tasting will also feature some much-debated </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Halloween candy pairings</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> for the tasting beers! Scroll down to the bottom of our newsletter to see the full line-up for this month.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/05ec7090-d652-6a9a-2ce4-2616f79c34e0.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>👀 </span></span></span></span><span><span>Fresssssssh hops from Triple Crossing<br>• </span></span><strong><span><span><span>Valhalla</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Hazy DIPA with Citra<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Battle Creek </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Hazy DIPA with Mosaic<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Clever Girl</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> IPA with Citra &amp; Mosaic</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/1908531d-dca0-b4d0-91ca-a92a716639ee.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f3af/72.png\" alt=\"🎯\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Lost Generation</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> doesn't miss<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Time Laid Bare</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Czech Pilsner<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Dying Moons &amp; Shadows </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Czech Dark Lager<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Tyranny of the Unimaginative</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Hazy IPA with Citra, Krush &amp; Riwaka</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/4b3e7b72-c398-4bda-12af-8692dcdd0fe4.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1fabd/72.png\" alt=\"🪽\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Local Hops<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>DC Brau On the Wings of Armageddon</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> West Coast DIPA with Falconers Flight<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Coastal Frames Janco </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Hazy Imperial IPA with Nelson Sauvin HopSauce, Idaho 7 &amp; Mosaic<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Benchtop Juicy Thunda From Down Unda</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Hazy DIPA with Peacharine &amp; Maui Nelson</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/69797386-b715-4a9e-3445-07e4b7211ff4.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>🤩 </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Union Craft</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> fall seasonals + year-round favorites<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Skipjack</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> German Pilsner</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Divine</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> West Coast IPA with Citra &amp; Mosaic</span></span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Foxy </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Red IPA with Centennial &amp; Columbus<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Blackwing</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Schwarzbier</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/1054af03-86b9-828d-abf6-945ff3799343.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1fa77/72.png\" alt=\"🩷\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Commonwealth</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> pretty in pink<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Pink Dahlia </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Hazy IPA with Pink Hops, Idaho Gem &amp; Nelson Sauvin LDH<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Zombie</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Gose Style Ale with Passionfruit, Pineapple, Orange, Apricot &amp; Lime Zest<br>•</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Falstaff </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>English Porter</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/46cb4854-cc5f-961f-49df-b3674247193b.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>&nbsp;Gimme gimme </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>The Veil</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Bone</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> West Coast IPA with Chinook, Citra, Mosaic, Columbus, Mosaic LupoMax, Nelson Sauvin, Citra LupoMax &amp; Columbus Cryo<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Incinerate</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Hazy DIPA with Citra &amp; Peacharine<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Not You Too</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> West Coast DIPA</span></span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/31adaee1-f845-836c-c82f-0fdcc2fa7e74.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f329_fe0f/72.png\" alt=\"🌩️\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Dark and stormy<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Victory Storm King </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Imperial Stout</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/5b63bc5f-6ea9-f17a-3f97-15eba48b9ba8.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f448/72.png\" alt=\"👈\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Left Hand</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> right answers only<br>•</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Mexican Hot Chocolate Stout</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> with Cocoa Powder, Chilis, Cinnamon &amp; Vanilla Beans<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Stout Mixed Pack</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Imperial Peanut Butter </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Nitro Milk Stout<br>•</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Wake Up Dead</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Imperial Stout</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/107e6782-5fb0-3302-d7f6-6ad771ce120c.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f1ee_1f1f8/72.png\" alt=\"🇮🇸\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Einstok </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>bock in stock<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Doppelbock</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><br>•</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Winter Ale </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>with spruce tips</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/62005482-fde0-ab2b-6f40-e23c4fd21bc1.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f328_fe0f/72.png\" alt=\"🌨️\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Snow in the forecast for </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Great Lakes </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Christmas Ale</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Barrel Aged Christmas Ale</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Snowscape </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Dark Lager</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/5040f057-3682-2508-dc2d-c412d554f369.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f384/72.png\" alt=\"🎄\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Holiday cheer for holiday beer<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Shiner Holiday Cheer </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Dunkelweizen with peaches &amp; roasted pecans<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Solace Griswold's Winterbock</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Doppelbock<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Bell's Christmas</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Scotch Ale<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Delirium Noel</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Belgian Winter Warmer<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Jack's Abby Extra Layer</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Winter Fest Lager<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>3 Floyds Alpha Klaus</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Holiday Porter</span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/4deba571-8fc3-bc1f-9480-144cb4d14728.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>💕 It’s baaaaaaaack!<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Troegs Mad Elf</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Belgian Ale with honey &amp; cherries</span></span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/10604529-7605-2e8f-864c-4676fbdbbfb8.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f525/72.png\" alt=\"🔥\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Always a blast </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Adroit Theory</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Help Me I'm in Hell</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Hoppy Saison<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Hazy Q</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Oat Cream IPA - collab with </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Icarus</span></span></span></strong></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/b7e6d4c6-1642-2601-d8be-bebb6789edad.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>💯 More VA holiday seasonals!<br>•</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Blue Mountain Lights Out </span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>Old Ale</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>Perennial Shelter From the Storm Hazy IPA</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>Widowmaker / Schilling Geomancer New Zealand Pilsner</span></span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/7bef1d6c-fc50-a92e-2a97-d2bd62093152.jpeg\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><strong><span><span><span>Laurent Perrachon Crémant De Bourgogne Brut Blanc de Blancs</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>: </span></span></span><span><span><span><span>A new Cremant from Burgundy graces the shelves this week. Check out Julie’s writeup, below, for all the details!</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>Folklore Carbonica:</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>Another in our long line of absolutely banging chillable reds here at The Brew Shop. Plush, poppy dark fruit and tannins that you'd expect from a Tannat / Cab blend, but the carbonic maceration keeps the body lighter and brighter. Touches of cocoa and baking spice with balanced acidity. Organic.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Les Anges Pinot Noir: </span></strong><span><span><span><span>Les Anges is a fun little French Pinot Noir that hits all the right notes. Bright fruit of dark and red berries, licorice, and some light savory notes pair with a classic French dustiness that lays a blanket of sophistication on top of this delightful party wine.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Growers Guild Cabernet Sauvignon: </span></strong><span><span><span><span>Big, bold, and unapologetically jammy. Bursting with ripe blackberry, brambly herbs, and rich dark chocolate, this full-bodied Cab brings plenty of dark fruit flavor and a smooth, satisfying finish. If you love a juicy Washington State Cabernet with plenty of richness, this one’s calling your name.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/aab4835f-26b8-74c0-c360-69849b480c1c.jpeg\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span>Where and when I grew up, sparkling wine was reserved exclusively for celebrations. Engagements, graduations, new jobs, all appropriate times for a bottle of bubbly. But Tuesday night? Not so much. Well sometimes it feels good to be wrong. A wise friend once told me you should have a bottle of sparkling in your fridge at-the-ready at all times. (It's Beth.) Why? Because sparkling wine is an anytime wine. (Just like cookies are an anytime food. Yeah, I said it - come at me Cookie Monster.) And if you have to tell yourself that sparkling is only for celebrations then you're going to have to learn to celebrate the small stuff, like maybe just the fact that it's Tuesday.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>The latest sparkler to grace our shelves is the </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Laurent Perrachon Cremant De Bourgogne Brut Blanc de Blancs</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>. Cremant is a fan favorite around here, because it takes a Champagne-style wine (made in France, the same way Champagne is made, but just not made in Champagne itself) and removes the Champagne-style pricing. Laurent Perrachon takes it next level for me personally by making a Blanc de Blancs. Blanc de Blancs is my favorite style of sparkling (oh how far I've come, to have a \"favorite style\" of Champagne / sparkling) as it's 100% Chardonnay and known for being lean, vibrant, and mineral driven. Laurent Perrachon is all those things plus crisp citrus, white flowers, and a gorgeous texture from extended lees aging. Like all Cremant, Laurent Perrachon is carbonated in the \"traditional method\" &nbsp;which creates a secondary fermentation in each individual bottle and results in those beautifully small and persistent bubbles. Lovely to look at, but even better to drink, even on a Tuesday.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><em><span><span><span><span>This week’s writeup is brought to you by Julie</span></span></span></span></em></p>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/44528625-75ce-77b6-246b-4628384a151b.jpeg\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p>Thanks for your business! See you soon, Beth, Julie &amp; Aidan and the entire Brew Crew</p>",
